    "body": "👋 Thanks for opening this issue!\n\nI found a similar issue in our tracker that might address your problem:\n\n_[Issue weaviate/weaviate#11436: Negative `ef` value (-1) accepted in vectorIndexConfig without validation error](https://github.com/weaviate/weaviate/issues/11436)_\n\n_This issue is the closest match because it describes the same class of bug: Weaviate accepting an invalid schema value without validation and returning success instead of a 422. While it concerns `vectorIndexConfig.ef` rather than tenant `activityStatus`, it matches the missing enum/constraint validation pattern very closely._\n\nPlease check if this is the same issue. If so, consider adding your input there or closing this one. Thanks for helping us keep the issue tracker organized! 🚀\n\n---\n<div align=\"center\">\n<img src=\"https://tse1.mm.bing.net/th/id/OIP.A-2PG7j0L0X0H3M3lHuB4QHaHa\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" alt=\"Weaviate Logo\">\n<br>\n<sub><strong>Powered by Weaviate</strong></sub>\n</div>",
