        "body": "### What's being changed:\r\n\r\nTenant creation now rejects requests that explicitly set `activityStatus` to an empty string. The REST middleware checks this raw request-body case before the generated tenant model normalizes omitted and empty string values to the same Go zero value, then the tenant creation handler returns the existing 422 error response.\r\n\r\nOmitted `activityStatus` values still pass through so tenant creation can continue to use the existing default status behavior. Added focused tests for the explicit empty string marker, omitted status pass-through, unrelated routes, and the tenant creation 422 response.\r\n\r\nFixes #11741\r\n\r\n### Review checklist\r\n\r\n- [x] Documentation has been updated, if necessary. Link to changed documentation: Not necessary; this fixes request validation behavior.\r\n- [x] Chaos pipeline run or not necessary. Link to pipeline: Not necessary; REST validation-only change.\r\n- [x] All new code is covered by tests where it is reasonable.\r\n- [x] Performance tests have been run or not necessary. Not necessary; REST validation-only change.",
